# Dictionary derivation inputs.
# Source corpora, frequency lists, pronunciation lexicons and especially word
# embedding models are large (embeddings run to gigabytes) and are third-party
# data with their own licenses. They are pinned by version and recorded in each
# dictionary's provenance header instead of being committed here.
tools/**/corpus/
tools/**/cache/
*.vec
*.bin
*.npy
*.npz
*.model
*.txt.gz
*.zip

# Derived dictionaries are committed deliberately, not swept in by a wildcard.
# Working scratch from derivation runs is not.
tools/**/work/
*.report.tmp
